WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.450
Claimant: Hi, I’m calling to report that my car was parked in an underground garage during a heavy rainstorm, and floodwater rose around it. Water reached the floorboards, and now it won’t start; the repair estimate is $6,200.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:43.100
Adjuster: Decision: covered. The claimant reports floodwater reaching the floorboards and the vehicle subsequently failing to start; water and flood are covered other-than-collision causes under the supplied clauses. Coverage prerequisites are established by DEMO-DECL, with payment subject to the applicable limit and declarations deductible, whose amounts are not supplied. Next action: Approve coverage and calculate payment using the repair estimate, applicable limit, and declarations deductible.
